# Stacks Integration Verification

## Package Versions
- @stacks/connect: 8.2.4
- @stacks/transactions: 7.3.1
- @stacks/network: 7.3.1
- @stacks/wallet-sdk: 7.2.0

## Integration Points

### Wallet Connection
- useStacks hook (frontend/hooks/useStacks.ts)
- Bitcoin wallet selector (frontend/components/wallet/bitcoin-wallet-selector.tsx)

### Contract Interactions
- Market creation (createMarket)
- Trading (buyOutcome)
- Market resolution (resolveMarket)
- Claiming winnings (claimWinnings)
- USDCx approvals (frontend/lib/usdcx-approval.ts)

### Read-Only Queries
- Market data (useMarkets, useMarket hooks)
- User balances (usdcx-balance.ts)
- User shares (user-shares.ts)
- Market count (market-count.ts)

### Testing
- All unit tests use @stacks/transactions for CV construction
- 12 test files with full Clarity value support

## Status: ✅ VERIFIED
All Stacks interactions use official @stacks packages.
No custom implementations or deprecated methods.
